  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Niue Wharf Feasibility Study</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity is a feasibility study to assess redevelopment options for Sir Robert&#x2019;s Wharf, Alofi, Niue to inform Government of Niue and development partners.
In 2018/19, the Government of Niue (GoN) requested assistance from the Asian Development Bank (ADB). This led to a pre-feasibility report on developing and improving port operations and facilities at&#xa0;the&#xa0;Wharf. This report identified four possible options and recommended further investigations and design development to assess feasibility.</narrative>
  </description>
